# dmypy.json

# Generated images: art the bot produces, downloads or renders. None of it is
# recoverable from the repo by design -- see supabase_storage.upload_image.
*.png

# ...but assets/card_art/ is SOURCE, not output. It is the game's own art,
# vendored so the bot renders without a Godot checkout (docs/CARD_RENDERING.md).
# Without this negation the blanket *.png above silently drops 157 of its 159
# files, and a fresh clone cannot draw a single card -- the borders and symbols
# would need `tools/sync_assets.py` and an azoth checkout, and the shader-exported
# backgrounds would need Godot itself.
!assets/card_art/**/*.png

